## Step 2: Pareto Front Analysis

Dominated check (maximize both):
- (437.9, 0.394): dominated by (356.6, 0.569) — lower modulus but higher PF dominates on PF; actually 437.9 > 356.6 on modulus but 0.394 < 0.569 on PF → neither dominates the other → both on Pareto front
- (356.6, 0.569): not dominated
- (355.3, 0.459): dominated by (356.6, 0.569) — both objectives worse
- (347.9, 0.385): dominated
- (232.7, 0.642): not dominated by (356.6, 0.569) since PF is higher

**Approximate Pareto front**: (437.9, 0.394), (356.6, 0.569), (232.7, 0.642)

